[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0010","text":"啊，那边的是……\n喂——阳希——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0020","text":"你是要去事务所吧。一起走吧\n……阳希？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0030","text":"那个……不好意思\n您……听到了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0040","text":"……？\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0050","text":"如果没听到的话\n那就没事……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0060","text":"…………啊，\n难道说，你刚才在唱歌？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0070","text":"……！\n您怎么知道的～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0080","text":"哈哈哈\n我也有过这种事嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0090","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22800500_01_0100","text":"呵呵……\nProducer先生也有过吗？"}]
